{"type": "sena", "_data": [{"contents": [{"type": "lesson_name", "content": "A Day With Vanessa"}, {"type": "unit_name", "content": "An Improvised Lunch"}, {"type": "position", "content": 5}, {"type": "origin", "content": "stub"}, {"type": "lesson", "content": 16}, {"type": "level", "content": "B1.2"}], "type": "metadata"}, {"contents": [{"type": "test", "content": "false"}], "type": "achievment_test"}, {"contents": [{"type": "primary", "content": "Use expressions about relationships and feelings in a range of social and work contexts. "}, {"type": "secondary_1", "content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations."}, {"type": "secondary_2", "content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations."}, {"type": "secondary_3", "content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations."}, {"type": "secondary_4", "content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations."}, {"type": "secondary_5", "content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations."}, {"type": "secondary_6", "content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations."}, {"type": "secondary_7", "content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations."}, {"type": "secondary_8", "content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations."}], "type": "objectives"}, {"contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "The Second Conditional - Talking About Hypothetical Situations"}, {"type": "describer", "content": " You use the second conditional to talk about unreal or imaginary (hypothetical) situations in the future."}, {"type": "text", "content": "For example: <br/><span class=\"italic\">If I had a million dollars, I would buy a car.</span>"}, {"type": "text", "content": "Do you have a million dollars?  No.<br/>Is it possible to suddenly get a million dollars? Not really.<br/>What would you do if you had a million dollars? Buy a car."}, {"type": "text", "content": "You use the Simple Past verb + <span class=\"italic\">would</span>"}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":5,\"columns\":3,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"IF\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Conditional\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Result\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"simple past\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"simple past\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"would + base verb\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"If\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"I married Peter,\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"I would be happy.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"If\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"it snowed next July,\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"I would be very surprised\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"If\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"I were you,\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"I would be jumping up and down.\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}"}, {"type": "text", "content": "Remember to use a comma (,) after the IF clause. "}, {"type": "text", "content": "In conversation, it is common to use contractions. (I would = I'd)."}, {"type": "example", "content": "If you went every day, you would get bored with it."}, {"type": "example", "content": "If I had my camera, I'd be taking pictures right now! "}, {"type": "example", "content": "If I had my shawl, we could sit on it."}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Talking about Wishes and Imaginary Situations"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "You use <span class=\"strong\">wish</span> and the second conditional to talk about things you want or would like to be different now or in the future."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Wishes and sentences in the second conditional infer that what you want is probably not possible, or for some reason impossible."}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":6,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Statement</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Meaning</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">I wish it were all that easy!</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"it's not that easy\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">If having it all were so easy, everyone would be happy.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"everyone is not happy\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">If college was actually like they showed it in the movies, it would be a snap!</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"college is not like they show it in the movies \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">I wish I could just go back for a few days and enjoy it all again.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"I can't go back\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">I wish I were young again!</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"I am not young anymore.\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border\"}"}, {"type": "example", "content": "I wish I could go every day!"}, {"type": "example", "content": "I wish I had my camera!"}, {"type": "example", "content": "I wish I wore my shawl."}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "crisp"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "cool; fresh; invigorating (when talking about the weather)"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: It's so clear and crisp outside. "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn7le16ob05aud01"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "These are words you use to talk about social activities."}], "type": "target_word_describer"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to jot down"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to write down quickly"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example:  I could jot a few ideas down."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn7le16ob05aud02"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "grassy"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "covered with grass"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: There are plenty of grassy areas and the ground seems dry."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn7le16ob05aud03"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "photo op"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "short for photo opportunity"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: What a great photo op! "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn7le16ob05aud04"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "shawl"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a piece of fabric worn by women over the shoulders"}, {"type": "part_speech",