elcome. I had a great time, too! I wish I could go every day!<br/><span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>:         Uh, if you went every day, you would get bored with it.<br/><span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>:     No way! The gallery has all kinds of exhibits throughout the year - I think a photography exposition is coming up next month.", "id": 1, "image": "engenn7le16ob05re2img05.jpg"}, {"time": "20250", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>:         Ooh! I love photography! If I had my camera, I'd be taking pictures right now! It's so clear and crisp outside. <br/><span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>:     If you had your camera, I'd be posing for you! Oh, since we missed our reservation at the restaurant, do you want to grab some lunch at the supermarket?<br/><span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>:         You mean, have a picnic? That's a fabulous idea! I wish I wore my shawl. If I had it, we could sit on it.", "id": 2, "image": "engenn7le16ob05re2img02.jpg"}, {"time": "46000", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>:     No worries. There are plenty of grassy areas and the ground seems dry.<br/><span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>:         Now I really wish I remembered my camera - what a great photo op! <br/><span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>:     If you took some pictures, you could use them for your blog. You could write about picnics.<br/><span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>:         You're right! I wish I had my laptop on me so I could jot a few ideas down.", "id": 3, "image": "engenn7le16ob05re2img02.jpg"}], "coverimg": "engenn7le16ob05re2img05.jpg"}}], "template_override": 1, "type": "audio", "_data": [], "id": 1, "title": ""}], "id": 0}]}